  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム 逆襲のシャア ベルトーチカ・チルドレン』よりネオ・ジオンの",
      "en": "Neo Zeon from \"Mobile Suit Gundam: Char's Counterattack Beltorchka Children\""
    },
    {
      "ja": "ニュータイプ専用MSであるサイコ・ドーガがHGスケールでついに初の立体化！",
      "en": "Newtype exclusive MS Psycho Doga is finally made into 3D for the first time in HGScale!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "「GUNDAM SIDE-F」で先行販売いたします。",
      "en": "Pre-sale at \"GUNDAM SIDE-F\"."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 独特な形状の頭部形状や背中の3本のバインダーを新規造形で再現。モノアイは可動式。",
      "en": "• The unique head shape and three binders on the back are reproduced with new modeling. Monoeye is movable."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 両肩に3基ずつファンネルを装備、展開状態を差し替えで表現が可能。",
      "en": "• Equipped with 3 funnels on each shoulder, the expanded state can be expressed by replacing them."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 各部関節が可動、特に腹部は上下左右に大胆に可動。様々なポージングが楽しめる。",
      "en": "• All joints are movable, especially the abdomen can move vertically and horizontally. You can enjoy various poses."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部・シールドのネオ・ジオンマークはパーツ分割で再現。",
      "en": "• The neo-Zeon mark on the head and Seal is reproduced by dividing the parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "※後日、プレミアムバンダイ（バンダイナムコグループ公式通販サイト）、THE GUNDAM BASE各店でも販売予定です。",
      "en": "*Later, it will be sold at Premium Bandai (Bandai Namco Group official mail order site) and THE GUNDAM BASE stores."
    }
  ],
